++ *
++ * @IFF_EXT_TUN_TAP: device is a TUN/TAP device
++ * @IFF_EXT_PPP_L2TPV2: device is a L2TPV2 device
++ * @IFF_EXT_PPP_L2TPV3: device is a L2TPV3 device
